  "body": "Lacking access to a serial number, privacy hashed serial number, DevicePath, etc., what is a good approach to finding out if requestDevice has returned a new device or one already in getDevices? And if it *is* in getDevices, what is a good way to determine which device it is?\r\n\r\nI'd like to make a table of paired devices (with a View button, and then a Pair New button using requestDevice), and while I can do this, if I pair new devices, lacking a way to compare them, I will have to reload and requery all of the devices, so I can't cache any information about it even locally. What's the best way to accomplish this?",
